{'symbol': 'AXP', 'date': '2021-12-02 08:41:00', 'title': "AMERICAN EXPRESS CHAIRMAN AND CEO STEPHEN J. SQUERI TO PARTICIPATE IN DELTA AIR LINES' CAPITAL MARKETS DAY", 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY (NYSE: AXP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ON THURSDAY, DECEMBER 16, 2021, CHAIRMAN AND CEO STEPHEN J. SQUERI WILL PARTICIPATE IN DELTA AIR LINES' CAPITAL MARKETS DAY IN NEW YORK. MR. SQUERI WILL JOIN DELTA CEO ED BASTIAN FOR AN IN-PERSON FIRESIDE CHAT FROM 11:40 A.M. TO 12:25 P.M. (ET). A LIVE WEBCAST OF THE FIRESIDE CHAT WILL BE ACCESSIBLE TO THE GENERAL PUBLIC THROUGH THE AMERICAN EXPRESS INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE AT HTTP://IR.AMERICANEXPRESS.COM. A"}